r
> PA -- a construction that means the same but uses KOhA instead.

Actually lerfu sort of work as variables for PA, because they share
many of their functions with PA:

 ro boi ny zo'u: ro da zo'u: ga nai da ny mei lo cukta gi li ny zmadu li mu

 su'o boi ny zo'u: ge lo nanmu cu ny mei gi lo ninmu cu ny mei

