or
> _xo (pau)_).

I suppose something like:

  mi djuno lo du'u li xo kau goi ny zo'u ko'a jinvi lo du'u vei ny
prenu cu zvati
  "I know how many people she thinks were there."

But I'm not sure whether "mo", or worse "ji", can be sumtified that easily.

